X:10
T:Maggy Lowther. JBa.10
T:Maggy Lowder,aka. JBa.10
T:Maggie Lauder,aka. JBa.10
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:1/4=80
C:unedited
B:Joseph Barnes MS,Carlisle,1762.
R:
O:
A:England, Carlisle
N:No time signature,no key signature, number of beats in a bar very
N:variable. Time signature chosen because I have to put something in.
N:Key signature because the begining of this appears to be a relative
N:of the song "Maggy Lowther" (see Maggie Lauder in J.Aird,HSJJackson)
N:Other than that, transcribed as written because otherwise it would not
N:be
N:editing, it would be rewriting.
N:Actually it makes a lot of sense if you play it. Numbers at begining of
N:sections are given in MS. NB"*" - Does the handwriting change here
N:NB# - impossible to tell duration...CGr
